    "fields": {
      "arohanam": "ascending scale, as base letters; the authority for upward motion",
      "avarohanam": "descending scale, as base letters; the authority for downward motion",
      "nyasa": "resting swaras - a phrase may legitimately end here",
      "jeeva": "life swaras - the raga's emphasised / characteristic notes",
      "graha": "swaras a phrase may legitimately begin on",
      "vakra": "zigzag sequences that are legal despite violating strict scale order",
      "prayogas": "characteristic phrases, used by the retrieval baseline and for evaluation",
      "varjya": "swaras absent from the raga entirely"
    },
    "note": "Values are stated as base letters (S R G M P D N). Variants are resolved per composition from its melakarta by swaraga.melakarta, so this file stays independent of any one composition's mela."
  },
